  ("Which is a necessary condition for deadlock?", ["Preemption", "Starvation", "Mutual exclusion", "Paging"], 2, "The four conditions are mutual exclusion, hold and wait, no preemption, circular wait."),
  ("Virtual memory allows...", ["Faster CPU", "More cache", "Bigger screens", "Programs larger than physical RAM to run"], 3, "Parts of programs are kept on disk."),
  ("A page fault occurs when...", ["A page is corrupted", "A required page is not in main memory", "The CPU overheats", "A file is deleted"], 1, "The OS must load the page from disk."),
